<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia frees remaining 10 E Timor activists.</title>
<headline>Malaysia frees remaining 10 E Timor activists.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>A Malaysian High Court on Thursday ordered the immediate release from jail of 10 human rights activists, detained after last weekend's disruption of an East Timor conference by a youth mob allied to the government.</p>
<p>The High Court overturned a lower court order on Wednesday that would have kept the activists in jail until Saturday to allow police to investigate whether to bring charges against them.</p>
</text>
